
Section
Tag="ENG"

[MapSettings]
LegendMap="19 April 2006, 9:32 PM|DefTech-Belew Research Center.||DefTech-Belew does research and development for the army.||1on1 ESL version by muczaczos"
LegendMapInBrief="|1: SPY INSERTION POINT.||2: BUILDING A.||3: BUILDING B.||4: BUILDING C."
ExpliMapInBriefSpy="Our opponents have bought the Deftech company and are using it as a front for their spying activities and as a supply center. Infiltrate the company and disrupt their operations."
ExpliMapInBriefSentry="Our customer has bought the Deftech company and has asked us to protect it from potential intruders."
ModesStrings=((ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Accomplish two of the four mission objectives to stop supplies.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Prevent the intruders from seizing two of the four mission objectives and stop supplies.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="You must accomplish two out of four objectives:|| Zone A: Neutralize one of the two terminals.|| Zone B: Take back one of the two hard disks to your point of departure.|| Zone C: Blow up a bomb in one of the four pre-determined positions.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="You must prevent the intruders from accomplishing two of their four objectives:|| Zone A: Neutralization of one of two terminals.|| Zone B: Theft of one of two hard disks. || Zone C: Placing a bomb on one of the four pre-determined positions.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Pick up and keep the data disks.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Prevent the intruders from seizing the data disks.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="The Deftech company site is made up of three buildings: Building A, Building B and Building C.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The Deftech company site is made up of three buildings: Building A, Building B and Building C.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must go through the level and get their hands on a certain number of disks. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Eliminate all of the members of the ARGUS PMC  who are present.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Eliminate all the intruders seeking to infiltrate the zone you defend.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="The Deftech company site is made up of three buildings: Building A, Building B and Building C.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The Deftech company site is made up of three buildings: Building A, Building B and Building C.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies, like the mercenaries, must eliminate the opposing team entirely."))
